# Cloudflare Pages reads this file. Max 2100 static rules, 100 dynamic.
#
# The benefits directory moved to its own origin, mil.xplabs.us. These two
# rules are not optional cleanup — the old path is in the README, in printed
# handouts, and in whatever anyone has already bookmarked or linked. 301 so
# search engines transfer the ranking rather than treating it as a new page.
